WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.447
A pivot is not limited to counts.

00:00:02.447 --> 00:00:06.057
We can also pivot a measure such as revenue.

00:00:06.057 --> 00:00:14.937
For example, one output row can represent one month, while separate columns show Laptop revenue, Mouse revenue,

00:00:14.937 --> 00:00:23.967
and Keyboard revenue. In that case, the measure is revenue, and we add the revenue values together for each category.

00:00:23.967 --> 00:00:29.721
Always identify both the row grain and the measure before interpreting a pivot result.
